{"seq":2,"slug":"compile-time-execution","title":"Nim 编译期执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/metaprogramming/compile-time-execution","wordCount":972,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"nim-编译期执行\">Nim 编译期执行</h1><p>Nim 内置了一个虚拟机（VM），能在编译阶段执行大部分 Nim 代码。这套机制被称为 CTFE（Compile-Time Function Evaluation），它使得开发者可以在编译期计算常量、生成查找表、校验数据格式、读取外部文件——一切都发生在最终二进制文件生成之前。CTFE 与宏系统协同但职责不同：宏变换 AST 结构，CTFE 计算值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>const</strong>：编译期常量声明，初始化表达式由 VM 求值，结果嵌入二进制</li>\n<li><strong>static 块/表达式</strong>：显式强制编译期执行，用于校验、预计算、编译期副作用</li>\n<li><strong>staticRead/staticExec</strong>：编译期文件读取和外部命令执行，将外部数据嵌入程序</li>\n<li><strong>compileTime pragma</strong>：标记仅编译期可调用的过程，运行时不生成任何代码</li>\n<li><strong>VM 限制</strong>：不支持 FFI（importc）、原始指针操作、多线程——这是安全边界</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"const-与编译期求值\">const 与编译期求值</h2><p><code>const</code> 声明要求其初始化表达式必须在编译期可求值。编译器会自动调用 VM 执行初始化代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"const&#10;  MaxConnections = 1024&#10;  DefaultTimeout = 30 * 1000  # 简单算术&#10;&#10;  # 复杂编译期计算也可以&#10;  FibTable = block:&#10;    var table: array[20, int]&#10;    table[0] = 0&#10;    table[1] = 1&#10;    for i in 2..&lt;20:&#10;      table[i] = table[i-1] + table[i-2]&#10;    table&#10;&#10;echo FibTable[15]  # 610 —— 编译期已计算完毕，运行时零开销\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  MaxConnections = 1024</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  DefaultTimeout = 30 * 1000  # 简单算术</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 复杂编译期计算也可以</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  FibTable = block:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var table: array[20, int]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    table[0] = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    table[1] = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 2..&#x3C;20:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      table[i] = table[i-1] + table[i-2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    table</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo FibTable[15]  # 610 —— 编译期已计算完毕，运行时零开销</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"static-块与-static-表达式\">static 块与 static 表达式</h2><p><code>static</code> 关键字有两种用法——作为语句块强制编译期执行，或作为表达式获取编译期计算结果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# static 块：在编译期执行副作用（如校验、日志）&#10;static:&#10;  echo &quot;编译中... 当前编译器版本: &quot;, NimVersion&#10;  assert sizeof(int) == 8, &quot;此代码仅支持 64 位平台&quot;&#10;&#10;# static 表达式：编译期计算并嵌入结果&#10;proc factorial(n: int): int =&#10;  if n &lt;= 1: 1&#10;  else: n * factorial(n - 1)&#10;&#10;const Fact10 = static(factorial(10))  # 3628800&#10;echo Fact10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># static 块：在编译期执行副作用（如校验、日志）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>static:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  echo \"编译中... 当前编译器版本: \", NimVersion</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  assert sizeof(int) == 8, \"此代码仅支持 64 位平台\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># static 表达式：编译期计算并嵌入结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc factorial(n: int): int =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if n &#x3C;= 1: 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else: n * factorial(n - 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Fact10 = static(factorial(10))  # 3628800</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo Fact10</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>与 const 区别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>const</code></td>\n<td><code>const x = expr</code></td>\n<td>声明编译期常量</td>\n<td>命名绑定，全局可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>static</code> 块</td>\n<td><code>static: stmts</code></td>\n<td>执行编译期副作用</td>\n<td>无绑定，用于校验/打印</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>static</code> 表达式</td>\n<td><code>static(expr)</code></td>\n<td>内联编译期求值</td>\n<td>可出现在任何表达式位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{.compileTime.}</code></td>\n<td>修饰 proc</td>\n<td>标记仅编译期可调用</td>\n<td>运行时不生成代码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"staticread-与-staticexec-编译期-i-o\">staticRead 与 staticExec：编译期 I/O</h2><p>Nim 允许在编译期读取文件内容或执行外部命令，将结果嵌入二进制文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# 编译期读取文件内容为字符串&#10;const&#10;  SqlSchema = staticRead(&quot;schema.sql&quot;)&#10;  Version = staticRead(&quot;VERSION&quot;).strip()&#10;  LicenseText = staticRead(&quot;LICENSE&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 编译期执行外部命令&#10;const&#10;  GitHash = staticExec(&quot;git rev-parse --short HEAD&quot;).strip()&#10;  BuildDate = staticExec(&quot;date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ&quot;).strip()&#10;&#10;echo &quot;Version: &quot;, Version, &quot; (&quot;, GitHash, &quot;) built at &quot;, BuildDate\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 编译期读取文件内容为字符串</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  SqlSchema = staticRead(\"schema.sql\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Version = staticRead(\"VERSION\").strip()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  LicenseText = staticRead(\"LICENSE\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 编译期执行外部命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  GitHash = staticExec(\"git rev-parse --short HEAD\").strip()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  BuildDate = staticExec(\"date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\").strip()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo \"Version: \", Version, \" (\", GitHash, \") built at \", BuildDate</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个能力极其强大——它让 Nim 程序可以在编译期从外部世界获取信息，而最终二进制文件是自包含的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"compiletime-pragma-与编译期过程\">compileTime Pragma 与编译期过程</h2><p>标记 <code>{.compileTime.}</code> 的过程只存在于编译期 VM 中，不会生成任何运行时代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"proc generateLookup(size: int): array[256, uint8] {.compileTime.} =&#10;  ## CRC8 查找表——编译期计算&#10;  const Polynomial = 0x07&#39;u8&#10;  for i in 0&#39;u8..255&#39;u8:&#10;    var crc = i&#10;    for _ in 0..7:&#10;      if (crc and 0x80) != 0:&#10;        crc = (crc shl 1) xor Polynomial&#10;      else:&#10;        crc = crc shl 1&#10;    result[i.int] = crc&#10;&#10;const Crc8Table = generateLookup(256)&#10;&#10;proc crc8(data: openArray[byte]): uint8 =&#10;  result = 0&#10;  for b in data:&#10;    result = Crc8Table[(result xor b).int]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>proc generateLookup(size: int): array[256, uint8] {.compileTime.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## CRC8 查找表——编译期计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const Polynomial = 0x07'u8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for i in 0'u8..255'u8:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var crc = i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for _ in 0..7:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if (crc and 0x80) != 0:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        crc = (crc shl 1) xor Polynomial</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        crc = crc shl 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result[i.int] = crc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Crc8Table = generateLookup(256)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc crc8(data: openArray[byte]): uint8 =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for b in data:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = Crc8Table[(result xor b).int]</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[源代码解析] --&gt; B[语义分析]&#10;    B --&gt; C{遇到 const/static?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[启动 Nim VM]&#10;    D --&gt; E[在 VM 中执行表达式]&#10;    E --&gt; F{执行成功?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[将结果嵌入 AST]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[报告编译错误]&#10;    G --&gt; I[继续编译]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| I&#10;    I --&gt; J[代码生成]\">graph TD\n    A[源代码解析] --&gt; B[语义分析]\n    B --&gt; C{遇到 const/static?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[启动 Nim VM]\n    D --&gt; E[在 VM 中执行表达式]\n    E --&gt; F{执行成功?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[将结果嵌入 AST]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[报告编译错误]\n    G --&gt; I[继续编译]\n    C --&gt;|否| I\n    I --&gt; J[代码生成]</pre><h2 id=\"vm-的能力边界与限制\">VM 的能力边界与限制</h2><p>Nim 的编译期 VM 支持大部分语言特性，但有明确的限制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# VM 支持的操作&#10;static:&#10;  var data: seq[int]&#10;  for i in 0..99:&#10;    data.add(i * i)            # seq 操作 ✓&#10;  let s = &quot;hello &quot; &amp; &quot;world&quot;  # 字符串操作 ✓&#10;  let t = {&quot;a&quot;: 1, &quot;b&quot;: 2}.toTable  # 标准库容器 ✓&#10;&#10;# VM 不支持的操作&#10;# static:&#10;#   let f = open(&quot;file.txt&quot;)   # ✗ FFI 调用（importc）&#10;#   var p = alloc(100)         # ✗ 原始内存操作&#10;#   spawn doWork()             # ✗ 多线程\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># VM 支持的操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>static:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var data: seq[int]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for i in 0..99:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data.add(i * i)            # seq 操作 ✓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let s = \"hello \" &#x26; \"world\"  # 字符串操作 ✓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let t = {\"a\": 1, \"b\": 2}.toTable  # 标准库容器 ✓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># VM 不支持的操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># static:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#   let f = open(\"file.txt\")   # ✗ FFI 调用（importc）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#   var p = alloc(100)         # ✗ 原始内存操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#   spawn doWork()             # ✗ 多线程</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>支持</th>\n<th>不支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整数/浮点/字符串运算</td>\n<td><code>importc</code> / FFI 函数调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>seq</code>、<code>Table</code>、<code>set</code> 等标准容器</td>\n<td><code>ptr</code> 操作 / <code>alloc</code> / <code>dealloc</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递归与闭包</td>\n<td>多线程 / <code>spawn</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常处理</td>\n<td>多层 <code>ref ref</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象构造与方法调用</td>\n<td><code>cast</code>（部分限制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>staticRead</code> / <code>staticExec</code></td>\n<td><code>importcpp</code> / 外部库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"when-条件编译与编译期分支\">when 条件编译与编译期分支</h2><p><code>when</code> 是 Nim 最常用的编译期控制流——它在语义分析阶段求值，false 分支的代码<strong>不参与编译</strong>（不做类型检查、不生成代码）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"when nimvm:&#10;  # 此分支仅在编译期（VM 内）执行&#10;  proc platformSpecific(): string = &quot;compile-time&quot;&#10;else:&#10;  # 此分支仅在运行时执行&#10;  proc platformSpecific(): string =&#10;    when defined(linux): &quot;linux&quot;&#10;    elif defined(macosx): &quot;macos&quot;&#10;    elif defined(windows): &quot;windows&quot;&#10;    else: &quot;unknown&quot;&#10;&#10;# 利用 when + 编译期常量做特性门控&#10;const EnableProfiling = defined(profiling)&#10;&#10;template profile(name: string, body: untyped): untyped =&#10;  when EnableProfiling:&#10;    let start = cpuTime()&#10;    body&#10;    echo name, &quot; took &quot;, cpuTime() - start, &quot;s&quot;&#10;  else:&#10;    body\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>when nimvm:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 此分支仅在编译期（VM 内）执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  proc platformSpecific(): string = \"compile-time\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 此分支仅在运行时执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  proc platformSpecific(): string =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    when defined(linux): \"linux\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    elif defined(macosx): \"macos\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    elif defined(windows): \"windows\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else: \"unknown\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 利用 when + 编译期常量做特性门控</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const EnableProfiling = defined(profiling)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>template profile(name: string, body: untyped): untyped =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  when EnableProfiling:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let start = cpuTime()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    body</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo name, \" took \", cpuTime() - start, \"s\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    body</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"编译期类型信息与反射\">编译期类型信息与反射</h2><p>Nim 在编译期提供了丰富的类型内省能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/typetraits&#10;&#10;proc describeType[T](x: T) =&#10;  when T is SomeInteger:&#10;    echo &quot;整数类型，大小 &quot;, sizeof(T), &quot; 字节&quot;&#10;  elif T is SomeFloat:&#10;    echo &quot;浮点类型，大小 &quot;, sizeof(T), &quot; 字节&quot;&#10;  elif T is object:&#10;    echo &quot;对象类型: &quot;, name(T)&#10;    # 编译期遍历字段&#10;    for fieldName, fieldValue in x.fieldPairs:&#10;      echo &quot;  &quot;, fieldName, &quot;: &quot;, typeof(fieldValue), &quot; = &quot;, fieldValue&#10;  else:&#10;    echo &quot;其他类型: &quot;, name(T)&#10;&#10;type Point = object&#10;  x, y: float64&#10;  label: string&#10;&#10;describeType(Point(x: 1.0, y: 2.0, label: &quot;origin&quot;))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/typetraits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc describeType[T](x: T) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  when T is SomeInteger:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo \"整数类型，大小 \", sizeof(T), \" 字节\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  elif T is SomeFloat:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo \"浮点类型，大小 \", sizeof(T), \" 字节\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  elif T is object:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo \"对象类型: \", name(T)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 编译期遍历字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for fieldName, fieldValue in x.fieldPairs:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      echo \"  \", fieldName, \": \", typeof(fieldValue), \" = \", fieldValue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo \"其他类型: \", name(T)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Point = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  x, y: float64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  label: string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>describeType(Point(x: 1.0, y: 2.0, label: \"origin\"))</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CTFE 计算量</mtext><mo>∝</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 其中 </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>编译期循环/递归的规模</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CTFE 计算量} \\propto O(n) \\text{ 其中 } n = \\text{编译期循环/递归的规模}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CTFE </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">计算量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其中</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">编译期循环</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">递归的规模</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>过于庞大的编译期计算（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n &gt; 10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）会显著拖慢编译速度，此时应考虑将计算结果序列化为外部文件再用 <code>staticRead</code> 加载。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Nim 的编译期执行能力使其在「编译期可做多少事」这个维度上远超大多数系统语言：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>const + CTFE 使查找表、CRC 表、编码表等可以在编译期一次性计算，运行时零开销</li>\n<li>staticRead/staticExec 打通了编译期与外部世界的通道（Git hash、版本号、SQL schema）</li>\n<li>when + defined() 提供了比 C 预处理器更安全的条件编译，false 分支不做语义检查</li>\n<li>VM 的明确限制（无 FFI、无指针）形成了安全边界，防止编译期执行产生不确定行为</li>\n<li>fieldPairs 等编译期反射原语使序列化、ORM 映射等元编程场景无需外部代码生成工具</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于如何通过 pragma 注解和效果系统进一步约束编译期与运行时的行为边界，参见 <a href=\"pragmas-effects\">Pragma 与效果系统</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Nim 编译期执行","id":"nim-编译期执行"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"const 与编译期求值","id":"const-与编译期求值"},{"level":2,"text":"static 块与 static 表达式","id":"static-块与-static-表达式"},{"level":2,"text":"staticRead 与 staticExec：编译期 I/O","id":"staticread-与-staticexec-编译期-i-o"},{"level":2,"text":"compileTime Pragma 与编译期过程","id":"compiletime-pragma-与编译期过程"},{"level":2,"text":"VM 的能力边界与限制","id":"vm-的能力边界与限制"},{"level":2,"text":"when 条件编译与编译期分支","id":"when-条件编译与编译期分支"},{"level":2,"text":"编译期类型信息与反射","id":"编译期类型信息与反射"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Nim 宏与模板系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/metaprogramming/macros-templates"},"next":{"title":"Nim Pragma 与效果系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/metaprogramming/pragmas-effects"}}